      "start": 1350,
      "end": 1356,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 44,
      "text": "With the consent of the parties, the application is heard finally.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1357,
      "end": 1423,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 45,
      "text": "2. This is an application seeking to quash First Information Report No.890/2024 registered with Police Station Sitabuldi, Nagpur, for the offence punishable under Section 376(2)(n) of the Indian Penal Code.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1425,
      "end": 1631,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Police Station Sitabuldi, Nagpur",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1521,
          "end": 1553
        },
        {
          "text": "Section 376(2)(n)",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1588,
          "end": 1605
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Penal Code",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1613,
          "end": 1630
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23071418702602386
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 46,
      "text": "2 apl1697.24.odt 3.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1632,
      "end": 1652,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 47,
      "text": "Mr. M.I. Haque, learned Counsel for the applicant, and Mr. A. Khwaja, learned Counsel for non-applicant No.2, have submitted that the matter has been amicably settled between the parties out of court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1653,
      "end": 1853,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "M.I. Haque",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1657,
          "end": 1667
        },
        {
          "text": "A. Khwaja",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 1712,
          "end": 1721
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.10968345403671265
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 48,
      "text": "Accordingly, non-applicant No.2 filed the affidavit, stating that \" the physical relationship between her and the applicant was consensual.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1854,
      "end": 1993,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19940336048603058
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 49,
      "text": "However, she lodged the first information report against him due to a misunderstanding.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1994,
      "end": 2081,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31153634190559387
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 50,
      "text": "Therefore, she does not want to proceed with the report and is ready to withdraw the criminal case.\"\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2082,
      "end": 2185,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20848339796066284
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 51,
      "text": "Succinctly, the facts of the case are that - In August 2021, non-applicant No.2 got acquainted with the applicant from 'Tinder Dating App'.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2186,
      "end": 2325,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Tinder Dating App",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2306,
          "end": 2323
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20226702094078064
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 52,
      "text": "After that, they were on talking terms on WhatsApp, and intimacy was developed between them.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2326,
      "end": 2419,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "WhatsApp",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 2369,
          "end": 2377
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24795854091644287
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 53,
      "text": "Thereon, friendship was converted into a love relationship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2420,
      "end": 2480,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27465853095054626
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 54,
      "text": "Both used to meet each other as and when they got the opportunity.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2481,
      "end": 2547,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2721066474914551
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 55,
      "text": "The first time, on 28-06-2022, the applicant visited her house and had sexual intercourse with her on the pretext that he would marry her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2548,
      "end": 2686,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "28-06-2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2567,
          "end": 2577
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27993282675743103
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 56,
      "text": "Afterwards, the things were repeated till 18-03-2024.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2687,
      "end": 2740,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "18-03-2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2729,
          "end": 2739
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19424988329410553
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 57,
      "text": "For about two years, they were in a consensual sexual relationship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2741,
      "end": 2808,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28492119908332825
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 58,
      "text": "However, in April 2024, the petitioner got married to another girl and, therefore, on 26-08-2024,\nnon-applicant No.2 lodged the report with Police Station Sitabuldi, Nagpur.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2809,
      "end": 2983,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "26-08-2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 2896,
          "end": 2906
        },
        {
          "text": "Police Station Sitabuldi, Nagpur",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2950,
          "end": 2982
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2219131886959076
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 59,
      "text": "Hence, the applicant filed this application.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2984,
      "end": 3028,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.30220016837120056
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 60,
      "text": "3 apl1697.24.odt 5.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3029,
      "end": 3049,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20235760509967804
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 61,
      "text": "Mr. M.I. Haque, learned Counsel for the applicant, has submitted that it is a case of consensual sexual relationship for about two years between the applicant and non-applicant No.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3050,
      "end": 3232,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "M.I. Haque",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 3054,
          "end": 3064
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.17600169777870178
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 62,
      "text": "Non-applicant No.2 is above 25 years of age at the time of the first incident and capable of understanding the consequences of the physical relationship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3233,
      "end": 3387,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24099746346473694
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 63,
      "text": "He has also drawn our attention to the affidavit filed by non-applicant No.2, wherein she has categorically stated that the physical relations between her and the applicant were consensual; however, due to a misunderstanding, she lodged the report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3388,
      "end": 3636,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11854282021522522
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 64,
      "text": "Therefore, she does not want to proceed with the complaint and is ready to withdraw the criminal complaint/case against the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3637,
      "end": 3771,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23133929073810577
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 65,
      "text": "It is further submitted that though the applicant and non- applicant No.2 had a sexual relationship, the same was consensual and, therefore, cannot be termed as Rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3772,
      "end": 3938,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20382581651210785
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 66,
      "text": "Moreover, non-applicant No.2/victim was a major, was well educated, and has secured a degree in engineering from the College of Engineering.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3939,
      "end": 4079,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "College of Engineering",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 4056,
          "end": 4078
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26198554039001465
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 67,
      "text": "She is doing service.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4080,
      "end": 4101,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.230451762676239
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 68,
      "text": "She knew the consequences of the physical relationship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4102,
      "end": 4157,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2781800925731659
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 69,
      "text": "Therefore, he has prayed to quash the first information report against the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4158,
      "end": 4243,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28741225600242615
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 70,
      "text": "Shubham Raju Harne vs The State Of Maharashtra Thr Ps ... on 12 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/111832852/\n2 6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4244,
      "end": 4383,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shubham Raju Harne vs The State Of Maharashtra",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 4245,
          "end": 4291
        },
        {
          "text": "12 December, 2024",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 4306,
          "end": 4323
        },
        {
          "text": "Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 4324,
          "end": 4337
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4690776765346527
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 71,
      "text": "Non-applicant No.2/victim has appeared through learned Counsel, Mr. A. Khwaja, who identified her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4384,
      "end": 4482,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "A. Khwaja",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 4452,
          "end": 4461
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1314285695552826
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 72,
      "text": "Non-applicant No.2/victim admitted the contents of the affidavit filed by her.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4483,
      "end": 4561,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14858995378017426
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 73,
      "text": "Non-applicant No.2 and her counsel supported the applicant's case and prayed to quash the first information report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4562,
      "end": 4677,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15366101264953613
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 74,
      "text": "4 apl1697.24.odt 7.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4678,
      "end": 4698,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.09738966077566147
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 75,
      "text": "Considering the aforesaid submissions, record and the affidavit filed by non-applicant No.2/victim, it reveals that non-applicant No.2 categorically admitted that she was having a consensual physical relationship with the applicant.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4699,
      "end": 4931,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1380082219839096
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 76,
      "text": "However, due to a misunderstanding, she has lodged the first information report, and therefore, she does not want to proceed with the same.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 4932,
      "end": 5071,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20294491946697235
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 77,
      "text": "Moreover, non-applicant No.2 has submitted that she wants to forget the past and for a better future; she has given no objection to quashing the first information report and the proceedings that would arise from the same.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 5072,
      "end": 5294,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16810615360736847
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 78,
      "text": "8. This Court, in Writ Petition No.272/2022 (Ganesh Shankar Pilane V. State of Maharashtra and another), decided on 11-03-2022, under similar circumstances, has exercised the inherent power to quash the proceedings.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RLC",
      "start": 5296,
      "end": 5511,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Writ Petition No.272/2022 (Ganesh Shankar Pilane V. State of Maharashtra and another",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 5314,
          "end": 5398
        },
        {
          "text": "11-03-2022",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 5412,
          "end": 5422
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5924121141433716
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 79,
      "text": "In the said case, the victim was minor; however, in the case in hand, the victim was major,\nwell-educated, and aware of the consequences of the physical relationship.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5512,
      "end": 5679,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.29792001843452454
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 80,
      "text": "Therefore, the observations made in the said decision cover the case at hand.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5680,
      "end": 5757,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19488297402858734
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 81,
      "text": "9. Apart from this, we have examined the record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5759,
      "end": 5807,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16286097466945648
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 82,
      "text": "It reveals that the relationship between the applicant and non-applicant No.2 was developed from the Tinder Dating App.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5808,
      "end": 5927,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Tinder Dating App",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 5909,
          "end": 5926
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25778263807296753
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 83,
      "text": "The same was converted into friendship, and afterwards, intimacy was developed between them, and, by the consent of non-applicant No.2, had a physical relationship with the applicant for 5 apl1697.24.odt about two years.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 5928,
      "end": 6148,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2441246062517166
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 84,
      "text": "The same is admitted by non-applicant No.2/victim by filing the affidavit.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6149,
      "end": 6223,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2870886027812958
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 85,
      "text": "However, she has lodged the report against the applicant due to a misunderstanding.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6224,
      "end": 6308,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.39535290002822876
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 86,
      "text": "It is to be noted that it is not a case of non-applicant No.2 that the applicant has forcibly exploited her by use of force.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6309,
      "end": 6433,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.40101638436317444
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 87,
      "text": "10. With regard to the peculiarity of the fact that the relationship was consensual and due to misunderstanding, the report was lodged by non- applicant No.2.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 6434,
      "end": 6593,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4875616729259491
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 88,
      "text": "Since she has to forget her past and for a better future, she does not want to proceed with the first information report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6594,
      "end": 6715,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5561788082122803
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 89,
      "text": "In such an eventuality, we deem it appropriate to exercise our inherent powers to secure the ends of justice.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6716,
      "end": 6825,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5057971477508545
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 90,
      "text": "Peculiar facts of the case show that both the applicant and non-applicant No.2 do not wish to continue with the prosecution.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6826,
      "end": 6951,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5672677159309387
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 91,
      "text": "The laws are made to give justice and not disturb the people's lives.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 6952,
      "end": 7021,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5900586843490601
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 92,
      "text": "In such peculiar facts, we are inclined to exercise inherent powers.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 7022,
      "end": 7091,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26135575771331787
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 93,
      "text": "11. In view of the above, the application is allowed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 7093,
      "end": 7146,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1872548609972
    },
